0","kind":"announcement","title":"Pig King is live at Steam Next Fest! 🐽💣","summary":"The demo is officially out. Call your frenemies, jump into the game, and roll in the mud. We hid a little something in this build 👀 No hints, but true OG players will know when they hit it. Play enough, and it’s yours. Here is what’s new in this updated Demo: - Lasers appear around levels where you can escape using the grappling hook, or when you get hit by a balloon. - Rebound the \"softlock\" function to the \"Done\" button when using a controller. - Camera shake can now be reduced or turned off e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691557","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1846018067945009","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"Calling all PIGassos!","summary":"By Royal Decree, we are officially launching the Pig King Art Contest! The terms are quite simple: you produce a piece of fine art, submit it to our high council, and if selected, your work will be permanently immortalized inside the full game 🖼️ Imagine loading into a match, looking at a wall, and stating: \"That’s my canvas.\" Truly, the ultimate dream 🐖💭 The Royal Protocol:Channel your inner PIGasso: Create anything piggie-related, royal, or thoroughly unhinged.Community Driven Selection: The w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:18:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945009","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1846018067939055","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"THE PIG KING DEMO IS OUT NOW! 👑","summary":"👇 YOU CAN NOW PLAY THE PIG KING DEMO ON STEAM! 👇 HERE IS YOUR ROYAL CHECKLIST: 1️⃣ Play the Demo. 2️⃣ Smash that Wishlist button on Steam (do it solemnly). 3️⃣ Drop your feedback and bug reports on Steam or in our Discord! 🗓️ EARLY ACCESS DATE LOCKED IN! Mark it in the mud: NOVEMBER 12TH. Set your royal alarms and cancel all non-piggie commitments. 🔥 STEAM NEXT FEST & CLASSIFIED SURPRISES Yes, we will be part of Steam Next Fest! And we have a few top-secret surprises lined up during the event...","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T18:03:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1844751498224564","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"Fan or victim of Survival Mode?","summary":"Whether you're obsessed or utterly traumatized by Survival Mode, Kevin from TwoPeaks breaks down everything that went through his head while building it 🧠 Want to try Survival Mode and judge the dev choices yourself? Join the Pig King playtestOr find a crew on Discord! TwoPeaks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T13:31:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224564","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1844751498218307","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"+10k playtesters can’t be wrong","summary":"Quick updates from the throne: The Playtest is LIVE again. Grab 3 friends, request a key, and fight for pig supremacy: Join it here. What’s new in this update? Check it out here. Missing a squad? Report to Discord to recruit new allies 🐖🐖🐖🐖 Already played and got gameplay clips? Drop them in our Discord. Let's see if whoever claimed the throne actually deserved it. Steam Page Makeover. We made it 70% more majestic. Inspect it with reverence and tell us what you think! See you in the mud ✊TwoPeak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T12:39:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1842846814443823","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 Is Live: Return to the Mud","summary":"Drag your friends into the arena, betray them, and take the crown. 🛠️ WHAT’S NEW IN PLAYTEST #2? New Game ModesSoccer & Survival: Kick balls or avoid dying. Standard royal pastimes.Race & Hold the Trophy: Run fast. Hoard shiny objects.Last Pig Standing: Deathmatch has been restructured. Points are now awarded based on survival placement rather than raw kill count.Level & Visual PolishTerrain Overhaul: Levels now feature proper loot crates, final decorations, and fewer accidental death pits.Swine","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T15:56:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1838407329253879","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Playtest","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋We want to give a massive thank you to everyone who participated in the playtest. Your reports have helped us track down a bug that was heavily impacting the experience for many of you. 🤔 What was happening? We detected a configuration issue that was forcing every single player worldwide to connect to the Europe server, regardless of where they live. Because of this, if you were playing from South America, North America, or other regions, you would experience massive lag, hit regi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:34:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329253879","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563590-1836506165577997","game_id":"steam-4563590","kind":"announcement","title":"First playtest available NOW","summary":"ːlunar2019smilingpigːThe gates are open!ːlunar2019smilingpigː The first Pig King playtest has officially begun! We're gradually inviting players from the waiting list to help us stress-test the game, find bugs and most importantly: discover what makes becoming the Pig King truly fun. If you're among the lucky few you will not have to face this challenge alone..Bring your own royal entourage Everyone invited to the playtest can invite up to three friends to join in on the mayhem.Pig King is best ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T13:01:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4563590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4563590":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4563590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5320690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4563590","app_id":4563590,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:41Z","sou